WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:06.172
Are you going to 
answer that?

00:00:07.841 --> 00:00:08.466
It's not mine. 

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:13.138
Hello, Matt.

00:00:14.431 --> 00:00:16.057
Sorry, who is this?

00:00:16.057 --> 00:00:17.809
There is a bomb 
under your seat. 

00:00:18.309 --> 00:00:18.935
If you...

00:00:24.232 --> 00:00:25.567
Do I have your 
attention?

00:00:26.735 --> 00:00:28.403
Did I do something 
to you?

00:00:28.403 --> 00:00:29.612
You sound so

00:00:29.612 --> 00:00:30.530
guilty. 

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:31.531
What do you want?

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:32.574
Drive

00:00:32.574 --> 00:00:33.992
to this location. 

00:00:35.326 --> 00:00:35.910
Honey,

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:37.120
something's
happened. 

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:38.663
There's a man who 
has put a bomb

00:00:38.663 --> 00:00:39.456
in the car. 

00:00:40.457 --> 00:00:41.541
Under our seats,

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:43.251
there are pressure 
triggers. 

00:00:44.794 --> 00:00:45.670
We can't get out. 

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:47.672
The car will explode. 

00:00:51.634 --> 00:00:52.218
We're here. 

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:54.053
Listen very carefully

00:00:54.053 --> 00:00:55.054
or I kill you. 

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:56.514
Open the glovebox. 

00:00:57.557 --> 00:00:58.308
Shoot him. 

00:00:59.434 --> 00:01:00.310
Why are you 
doing this?

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:02.270
What have I ever 
done to you?

00:01:02.270 --> 00:01:02.979
Dad.

00:01:02.979 --> 00:01:03.813
His life

00:01:03.813 --> 00:01:04.355
or yours. 

00:01:04.355 --> 00:01:05.231
Matt.

00:01:05.231 --> 00:01:05.940
I'm your best friend. 

00:01:12.697 --> 00:01:14.282
You're a murderer 
now, Matt. 

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:18.036
You think I'm 
the bomber. 

00:01:19.996 --> 00:01:21.080
Well, I guess you've 
had a tough day. 

00:01:22.999 --> 00:01:23.792
I know 

00:01:23.792 --> 00:01:25.376
that you lost a 
lot of money

00:01:25.376 --> 00:01:26.169
for your clients

00:01:26.169 --> 00:01:27.378
who invested in 
your fund. 

00:01:28.046 --> 00:01:29.297
No!

00:01:30.548 --> 00:01:32.258
A lot of people are 
worried about you. 

00:01:35.512 --> 00:01:36.888
You've got everybody's 
attention, Matt. 

00:01:40.391 --> 00:01:41.309
He is still out there. 

00:01:42.143 --> 00:01:42.769
If you can't find him, 

00:01:42.769 --> 00:01:43.228
I will. 

00:01:44.062 --> 00:01:45.271
I am in control here. 

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:45.855
No you're not!

00:01:45.855 --> 00:01:46.856
You hurt my 
daughter,

00:01:46.856 --> 00:01:48.024
you son of a bitch. 

00:01:48.024 --> 00:01:48.858
I will kill you.

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:51.528
What's it gonna be?

00:01:53.696 --> 00:01:54.155
Drive. 

